{
  "about": "Product recognition rules. Rules are checked top to bottom and the first match wins, so keep specific rules above general ones. Every key in `match` must hold. vendor: case-insensitive substring of the OUI manufacturer. services: any of these Bonjour service types advertised. model: regex on the Bonjour model (TXT model/md/am). upnpModel / upnp: regex on the UPnP modelName / friendlyName. name: regex on any host name (DHCP, Bonjour, DNS, NetBIOS) or Bonjour instance name. Regexes are case-insensitive. `product` is optional; without it the rule only sets the device type.",

